== Access ==
; Bus
* Immediately at Tamura Shrine bus stop (30 minutes from {{ill|Kibukawa Station|ja|貴生川駅|zh|貴生川駅}}) via {{ill|Koka City Community Bus|ja|甲賀市コミュニティバス|zh|甲贺市社区巴士}} (Aikuru Bus Tsuchiyama Main Line)
; Car
